# Illvoi Operative: 2/1; "Whenever you cast your second spell each turn, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Turn 1: Bot1 casts Mox Sapphire, then the
# Operative itself as its second spell (it is not yet on the battlefield: no trigger), then Mox Jet as the third: still 2/1. On turn 2 Bot2's two
# Ornithopters do not count. On turn 3 Bot1's second spell (Ornithopter, after Mox Pearl) triggers it; the ability is on the stack above the
# Ornithopter and resolves first (3/2); the third spell (Mox Ruby) adds nothing.

